# Purpose
Public guide to reading declared Architecture diagrams, changing Focus/Flow/
Layers layouts and opening keyboard/touch component details. Clarify that green
is focus, red is an explained concern, and graph reach is not measured impact.
# Privacy
Product-facing behavior only. No private sources, hostnames, account data,
implementation routes, secrets or promises of automatic verification.
# Verification
Cross-checked against the native Architecture renderer and responsive Chromium
fixture. CATALOGUE entry is coordinated with the public help maintainer.
